{"id": "4038262a-3790-4615-b367-4ff4bbe5752b", "slug": "ray-of-light-1", "title": "Ray of Light", "description": "Ray Light Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Ray of Light\"\ndescription: \"Ray Light Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF6200\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#FF7800\"\n  background: \"#000000\"\n  surface: \"#3A0800\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Ray of Light\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 23; favorites: 9; remixes: 4.\nTags: button, animated, dither, action, effect, cta.\n## Overview\nRay Light Button Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nLuminance Core Calibrate RAY OF LIGHT THE SOURCE OF LIFE\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: RAY OF LIGHT.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF6200, secondary #000000, accent #FF7800, background #000000, surface #3A0800, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Ray of Light</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-zinc-950 overflow-hidden antialiased relative w-full h-screen text-white font-sans selection:bg-orange-900 selection:text-orange-50\">\n\n    <!-- Cinematic Grain Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 opacity-[0.05]\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,%3Csvg viewBox=%220 0 200 200%22 xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%3E%3Cfilter id=%22noise%22%3E%3CfeTurbulence type=%22fractalNoise%22 baseFrequency=%220.85%22 numOctaves=%223%22 stitchTiles=%22stitch%22/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width=%22100%25%22 height=%22100%25%22 filter=%22url(%23noise)%22/%3E%3C/svg%3E'); mix-blend-mode: overlay;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Deep Ambient Background Gradients -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 85% 50%, #9e2a00 0%, #3a0800 40%, #0a0302 90%);\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-60\" style=\"background: radial-gradient(circle at 75% 50%, rgba(255, 120, 0, 0.2) 0%, transparent 60%);\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Minimal Header / Controls -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-8 w-full px-8 md:px-16 z-40 flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-thin tracking-widest text-orange-200/50 uppercase\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:sun-fog-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span>Luminance Core</span>\n        </div>\n        <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:tuning-square-2-linear\" class=\"text-lg\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n            <span>Calibrate</span>\n        </button>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Typography Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full h-full z-20 flex flex-col justify-center pl-8 md:pl-24 lg:pl-32\">\n        <div class=\"relative reveal-trigger inline-flex flex-col max-w-fit\">\n\n            <!-- Masked Staggered Title -->\n            <!-- Using a custom clip-path to mask the bottom but allow the intense text shadow to bleed upward and outward -->\n            <h1 class=\"text-7xl md:text-9xl font-semibold tracking-tight uppercase flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 md:gap-x-8 leading-none\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255,240,220,0.6), 0 0 60px rgba(255,100,0,0.4), 0 0 120px rgba(200,40,0,0.3);\">\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] title-word\">RAY</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] title-word\">OF</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[110%] title-word\">LIGHT</span>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Masked Sub Labels -->\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between w-[95%] md:w-full mt-8 md:mt-12 text-xs text-orange-100/80 uppercase tracking-[0.4rem] md:tracking-[0.8rem] font-thin\">\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[120%] label-word\">THE</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[120%] label-word\">SOURCE</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[120%] label-word\">OF</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"inline-block\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(-50% -50%, 150% -50%, 150% 100%, -50% 100%);\">\n                    <span class=\"inline-block transform translate-y-[120%] label-word\">LIFE</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- 3D Cinematic Radial Shape Container -->\n    <div id=\"sculpture-container\" class=\"absolute top-1/2 right-[-15vw] md:right-[-5vw] -translate-y-1/2 z-10 w-[70vw] md:w-[50vw] h-[150vh] origin-right pointer-events-none\">\n        <!-- JavaScript injects layered blades here -->\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- 3D Radial Sculpture Generation ---\n            const container = document.getElementById('sculpture-container');\n            const numBlades = 42;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < numBlades; i++) {\n                const blade = document.createElement('div');\n                blade.className = 'absolute top-1/2 right-0 origin-right blade opacity-0';\n\n                // Responsive dimensions simulated via inline percentages\n                blade.style.width = window.innerWidth > 768 ? '65vw' : '90vw';\n                blade.style.height = '6vw';\n                blade.style.minHeight = '35px';\n\n                // Feathered / curved blade shape (tapered on the left, flat on the right pivot point)\n                blade.style.borderRadius = '100% 0 0 100% / 50% 0 0 50%';\n\n                // Spread the blades across a beautiful sweeping arc (-85deg to 85deg)\n                const progress = i / (numBlades - 1);\n                const angle = -85 + (progress * 170);\n                blade.style.transform = `translateY(-50%) rotate(${angle}deg)`;\n\n                // Keep overlapping correctly\n                blade.style.zIndex = i;\n\n                // Premium glossy gradient + sharp 3D specular edge highlights\n                blade.style.background = `\n                    linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.5) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 8%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 85%, rgba(0,0,0,0.8) 100%),\n                    linear-gradient(to right,\n                        #ffedcc 0%,\n                        #ff6200 15%,\n                        #a11b00 45%,\n                        #1f0400 80%,\n                        #050100 100%\n                    )\n                `;\n\n                // Soft shadow and internal rim light to create intense physical thickness\n                blade.style.boxShadow = `\n                    0px 18px 45px -8px rgba(0,0,0,0.95),\n                    inset 0px 2px 4px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4),\n                    inset 0px -4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\n                `;\n\n                container.appendChild(blade);\n            }\n\n            // --- Animation Timelines ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: 'power3.out' } });\n\n            // 1. Hypnotic Unfurling of the Blades\n            tl.to('.blade', {\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 2.5,\n                stagger: {\n                    amount: 1.8,\n                    from: \"center\"\n                },\n                ease: 'power2.out'\n            }, 0.2);\n\n            // 2. Masked Staggered Text Reveal\n            tl.to('.title-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1.6,\n                stagger: 0.18,\n                ease: 'expo.out',\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.reveal-trigger',\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            }, 0.6);\n\n            tl.to('.label-word', {\n                y: '0%',\n                duration: 1.4,\n                stagger: 0.12,\n                ease: 'expo.out',\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: '.reveal-trigger',\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            }, 1.0);\n\n            // 3. Ambient Breathing & Sweeping Motion\n\n            // Subtle sway of the entire hub\n            gsap.to(container, {\n                rotation: -4,\n                duration: 16,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            // Organic flexing of individual blades\n            const blades = gsap.utils.toArray('.blade');\n            blades.forEach((blade, index) => {\n                gsap.to(blade, {\n                    rotation: `+=${2 + (index % 2.5)}`,\n                    scaleX: 1.015 + (index % 3) * 0.005,\n                    duration: 5 + (index % 3),\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                    delay: index * 0.06\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Handle resize elegantly\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                const width = window.innerWidth > 768 ? '65vw' : '90vw';\n                blades.forEach(blade => blade.style.width = width);\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "ray-of-light-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/ray-of-light-1.jpg", "source_name": "ray-of-light-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 206, "forks": 11, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:42:25.285417+00:00"}